            "detailed_description": "<h1>Accolades</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/3dd8d68e91546959796ad3f7bf304d68.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/3dd8d68e91546959796ad3f7bf304d68.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/3dd8d68e91546959796ad3f7bf304d68.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/556af271c71fecf06d05844c3f124fc9.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/556af271c71fecf06d05844c3f124fc9.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/556af271c71fecf06d05844c3f124fc9.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver Us The Moon passa-se num futuro próximo em que os recursos naturais do Planeta Terra estão esgotados. Num esforço para resolver a crise de energia, as potencias mundias criaram a Agência Espacial do Mundo e asseguraram uma nova fonte de energia promissora na lua. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Agência Espacial do Mundo colonizou e atuou a partir da lua, até certa noite fatídica se perderem todas as comunicações com o planeta Terra, assim como a fonte de energia. Agora, anos depois, assumes o papel do último astronauta da Terra numa missão de fazer ou morrer para investigar o que se passou e salvar a humanidade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/80b1f8b5312ce43230fbf6c049d35c8e.avif?t=1782220662\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ao longo desta aventura, o teu único companheiro é um pequeno robô denominado ASE. Juntos irão atravessar a lua, explorar instalações abandonadas, reunir pistas e finalmente desvendar os segredos e agendas ocultas em jogo. Só confiando nas tuas capacidades é que serás capaz de salvar a lua!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORAÇÃO NARRATIVA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As ruínas de missões lunares prévias têm muitas histórias e segredos para contar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usa o equipamento do teu astronauta para desvendar os momentos finais da colónia lunar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/efa4d56d32141263520c3a5428d80bdf.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/efa4d56d32141263520c3a5428d80bdf.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/efa4d56d32141263520c3a5428d80bdf.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NAVEGA POR ENTRE PERIGOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não há oxigénio no espaço, e sistemas avariados impedem a tua viagem até e na própria lua. Sobreviver estes perigos requer a mente de um aventureiro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PUZZLES AMBIENTAIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As bases lunares caíram num estado de degradação e tornaram-se num desafio para navegar. Desbloqueia ferramentas para superares os obstáculos e perigos que bloqueiam o teu caminho.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/dc42e4c54404f6e9aa8803eae8d8f20c.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/dc42e4c54404f6e9aa8803eae8d8f20c.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/dc42e4c54404f6e9aa8803eae8d8f20c.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOGA NA LUA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flutua pelo espaço e plana sobre a paisagem lunar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sente liberdade sem peso e atravessa a lua a pé, de rover lunar e monocarril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GeForce RTX Recommended Spec:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPU: RTX 2060 or higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU: i3-9100F @3.6GHz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAM: 16GB</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings: RT Epic, DLSS Quality, 1080p. Max Settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win 10 OS: RS5 or newer</p></li></ul>",
