capaz de salvar a lua!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORAÇÃO NARRATIVA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As ruínas de missões lunares prévias têm muitas histórias e segredos para contar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usa o equipamento do teu astronauta para desvendar os momentos finais da colónia lunar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/efa4d56d32141263520c3a5428d80bdf.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/efa4d56d32141263520c3a5428d80bdf.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/efa4d56d32141263520c3a5428d80bdf.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NAVEGA POR ENTRE PERIGOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não há oxigénio no espaço, e sistemas avariados impedem a tua viagem até e na própria lua. Sobreviver estes perigos requer a mente de um aventureiro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.poster.avif?t=1782220662\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.webm?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/428660/extras/c29659017d77f4e8ad8e40b179863cf5.mp4?t=1782220662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag