                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 486,
                            "playtime_at_review": 368,
                            "last_played": 1793769996
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's genuinly a good game with a lot to like. Graphics are nice and overall quite atmospheric, the narrarion is also engaging with different mechanics done well. I specifically enjoyed the part on the surface of the moon where the isolation feels unreal. Only issue is raytracing lags my game so much in the final chapter such that it becomes unplayable, and I had to turn off raytracing for that final part of the game. Other than that, bravo! I look forward to playing the second installment when I pick that up.",
